    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1pdb_1_1_i_p_d_b_injected_source" kindref="compound">IPDBInjectedSource</ref> defines an interface used to represent source files which were injected directly into the PDB file during the compilation process. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is used, for example, to add natvis files to a PDB, but in theory could be used to add arbitrary source code. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
